{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Mainstream NDP ideology best be summed up by Barrett’s insistence that 'we are not a labour party' but 'a party which represents the common interests of the common man.'">Barrettites</span>!} strength: [+ Barrettites_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ Barrettites_dissent : dissent +]

